# React Frontend Rules

## Architecture
- Feature-Sliced Design: entities/features/pages/widgets/shared
- Custom pathname-based routers (no React Router)
- MobX for app state, TanStack Query for server state
- OpenAPI-generated API clients via @app/frontend/api-client
- Shared UI components from @app/frontend/ui

## Patterns
- All apps wrap with <UiErrorBoundary> from @app/frontend/ui
- API clients in React context providers
- Per-API hooks: useAuthApiClient, useAdminApiClient
- i18n via @app/common/i18n with supported locales
- Error boundaries on all route groups

## Testing
- Vitest with happy-dom environment
- FSD boundary tests verify layer imports
- Integration tests with mocked API client
- E2E via Playwright fullstack tests

## Styling
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Design tokens from @app/common/design-tokens
- CSS modules for component-scoped styles
